  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">銅魔像</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\"> forge/fabric</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">這個模組會在你的遊戲中加入銅魔像。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">製作方法需將以下方塊由上至下堆疊：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> 1. 切製銅半磚（置於底部）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> 2. 銅磚或切製銅磚（置於中間）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> 3. 避雷針（置於頂部）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">牠會每10秒按一次按鈕。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">會像銅磚一樣氧化生鏽。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可使用蜂巢為其上蠟防腐。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若附近有閃電擊落，會導向銅魔像。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">未上蠟的銅魔像遭雷擊時會清除鏽蝕。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">對其使用雞蛋可加速氧化，用斧頭則能除鏽拋光。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">牠會不時轉動頭部，對其使用銅錠也會觸發轉頭。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可用銅錠馴服，馴服後會在近距離跟隨玩家。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可用銅錠恢復生命值。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">死亡時會掉落若干銅錠。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">希望您喜歡這個模組。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若發現錯誤或有任何建議，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請在下方留言告知。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Forge與Fabric版本可在檔案頁籤中找到。</p><p>Fabric版本目前暫無設定選項。<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感謝下載我的模組！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>",
